🏐 LOWER SCHOOL DODGEBALL COMPETITION! 🏐 The Lower School was full of energy, teamwork and plenty of dodging as students battled it out in our exciting Dodgeball Competition! 🔥Our students showed fantastic team spirit, determination and resilience throughout the competition. 💪 A huge well done to everyone who took part and gave it their all! 👏🏆 #HAWI #LowerSchool #Dodgeball #HouseCompetition #Teamwork #Resilience #SchoolSport #PE
