🏃 Get active with us! Join us for our Open Evening and discover all that our PE department has to offer. Explore our facilities, meet our students and find out how we encourage teamwork, resilience, confidence and a lifelong love of being active. #HAWI #OpenEvening #PE #Sport #SchoolLife
