🍪👩‍🍳 Something delicious is cooking at HAWI! Join us for an open evening! Take a tour of our outstanding school and explore our various departments while discovering the exciting experiences and activities we offer. In the Food Technology department, our students are working hard to prepare delicious cookies for you to enjoy! We can’t wait to welcome you — and don’t forget to save room for a treat! 😋🍪 #HAWI #OpenEvening #FoodTechnology #Cooking #Creativity #SchoolLife
