🔬➗ The Science and Maths departments are buzzing with exciting experiences and activities tonight! Join us for our Open Evening and explore the amazing projects, experiments and challenges our students are working on. From investigating how things work to solving problems and putting ideas into practice, there’s plenty to discover! Come and see learning in action! ✨ #HAWI #OpenEvening #Science #Maths #STEM #SchoolLife
