📚🌍 Discover, explore and be inspired! Join us for our Open Evening and discover the many ways our students explore the world around them. From fascinating stories and different cultures to the people, places and events that have shaped our world, there are so many opportunities to be curious, ask questions and develop a deeper understanding of the world we live in. #HAWI #OpenEvening #Learning #Explore #Inspiration #SchoolLife
