Join us for our Open Evening and discover the exciting world of Drama and Art at HAWI. Explore our creative spaces, see the amazing work our students produce and discover how we encourage imagination, self-expression, confidence and creativity through the arts. From bringing ideas to life on the stage to creating them on the page, there’s something for everyone to enjoy! ✨ Come and see where creativity comes to life! 🎭🖌️ #HAWI #OpenEvening #Drama #Art
