✨ EXTRA-CURRICULAR CLUBS ARE BACK! ✨ Our extra-curricular clubs begin week commencing 14th September! 🎉 At HAWI, we’re incredibly proud of our extensive programme and the opportunities it gives students to discover new passions, develop confidence and resilience, and build a lifelong love of learning. 💫 From morning clubs and lunchtime activities to after-school sessions, there’s something for everyone! 📚🎨⚽🎭🎶 We encourage all our students to get involved, try something new and make the most of the opportunities available beyond the classroom. 🌟 #HAWI #Extracurricular #Enrichment #StudentLife #BeyondTheClassroom #DiscoverYourPassion #SchoolLife
