📚✨ Library lessons are officially underway! It’s been a fantastic first week in the library, with students eager to discover new books, share their recommendations and talk about their favourite stories. 📖💬 Our Year 7 and 8 students had lots of fun with a Book Bingo activity, giving them the chance to get to know each other, discover what their classmates are reading and find some exciting new books to add to their reading lists! 🎲📚 Here’s to a year full of reading, discovering and sharing stories! ❤️📖 #LibraryLessons #BookBingo #ReadingCommunity #ReadingForPleasure #Schoollibrary
